  "title": "fix CDI 1655106 (from  RTR - BGP RPKI update ASPA pdu to latest draft)",
  "description": "\nCID reported here https://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/merge_requests/20305#note_2585104905\n\n```\n*** CID 1655106:         Code maintainability issues  (UNUSED_VALUE)\n/builds/wireshark/wireshark/epan/dissectors/packet-rpki-rtr.c: 321             in dissect_rpkirtr_pdu()\n315                     if(version < 2){\n316                         /* Error about wrong version... */\n317                         expert_add_info(pinfo, ti_type, &ei_rpkirtr_wrong_version_aspa);\n318                     } else {\n319                         // draft-ietf-sidrops-8210bis-21\n320                         // flags 1B\n>>>     CID 1655106:         Code maintainability issues  (UNUSED_VALUE)\n>>>     Assigning value from \"proto_tree_add_item(rpkirtr_tree, hf_rpkirtr_flags, tvb, offset, 1, 0U)\" to \"ti_flags\" here, but that stored value is overwritten before it can be used.\n321                         ti_flags = proto_tree_add_item(rpkirtr_tree, hf_rpkirtr_flags, tvb, offset, 1, ENC_BIG_ENDIAN);\n322                         offset += 1;\n323                         // zero 1B\n324                         proto_tree_add_item(rpkirtr_tree, hf_rpkirtr_reserved, tvb, offset, 1, ENC_NA);\n325                         offset += 1;\n326                         // length 4B\n```\n\n![Screenshot_2025-06-26_at_00.08.10](/uploads/79ada8431d8f5232d28b19d8468764e9/Screenshot_2025-06-26_at_00.08.10.png)",
